        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nell Williams, Lena Headey, George R. R. Martin, Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, Jonathan Rhys Meyers\n- Characters: Cersei Lannister\n- Works: Game of Thrones, A Song of Ice and Fire, London Town, The Image\n- Organizations: HBO\n\nFacts:\n- The Image premiered on HBO on January 27, 1990.\n- Cersei Lannister is a fictional character in George R. R. Martin's A Song of Ice and Fire and in its television adaptation Game of Thrones.\n- Lena Headey portrays Cersei Lannister in Game of Thrones.\n- In 2015, Nell Williams portrayed a younger version of Cersei Lannister in flashback sequences of the opening episode of Game of Thrones Season 5.\n- In London Town, Nell Williams appeared alongside Daniel Huttlestone, Dougray Scott, Natascha McElhone, and Jonathan Rhys Meyers.",
